					"nextDialogs": [
						721780404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721780404,
					"content": "（這座神龕樸素卻優雅，木造的龕體微微閃爍著流光，以端莊的沉默迎接來客的供奉。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神龕"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780405,
					"content": "（神龕旁邊散落著許多神櫻花瓣，看起來不像是自然所成，卻像是有人特意在這裡灑下了緋櫻繡球。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神龕"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780406,
					"content": "唔…這裡也沒有痕跡呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780407,
						721780408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780407,
					"content": "看，緋櫻繡球…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721780409,
					"content": "對哦，長次提到過他媽媽會在神龕供奉這個的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780410,
					"content": "這麼多花瓣出現在這裡…應該不會是偶然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780411,
					"content": "我們快回去告訴他吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
